---
name: repo-skills
description: Load named project skills ({{SKILL_NAMES}}) from their authoritative .agents/skills tree.
---

# {{PROJECT_NAME}} repository skills

All project skills live in `.agents/skills/`.

When a task names a repository skill, read `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` completely before
acting, then resolve its relative references from that skill directory. Do not search for or create
copies under `.claude/skills/`; this command installs only the `repo-skills` discovery bridge
in the Claude skill tree. Existing legacy copies and custom skills may remain; legacy copies are
not refreshed by this command.
